#MAXMODEL ASCII
# model: vff_mfburst
# Native Sunbeam ground crown, smoke and light; launch nodes removed.
# All native emitter geometry, textures, particle properties and motion remain.
# Palette changed to white; animation origin rebased from stock time 0.466667.
# Keys crossing the cut are interpolated, retaining the native contact ramp.
# Play at the travelling hand fan's ground contact; never rotate this upright.
